# Account and access

Read `docs/memory/workflows/auth-and-access.md` before editing.

- Access is decided on the server and in the database, not by a visible tab or `localStorage` “View as buyer.”
- `mayUseStoryPro` / `requireStoryPro` gate Archie APIs. Consumers and `other_professional` do not get Intelligence.
- TREC success never grants office (`managing_broker`). Office is a separate, explicit path.
- Login and Create account must not share typed secrets.
- Forced sign-out uses `forced_logout_at`. Other devices must honor it.
- Preserve consumer / individual Pro / managing broker / other professional distinctions.
